        "display_name": "Skyrim Milk Maid Lore",
        "content": "# Skyrim Milk Maid Lore\n\n**Context:** Basic lore about Milk Maids.\n\n**Tone:** Silly, sexy, humorous.\n\n**Milk:** Produced by Milk Maids rather than cows. Common drink with exotic aphrodisiac properties.\n\n**Society:** Milk Maids are valued providers of Skyrim's milk supply.\n\n**Treatment:** Respected as part of Skyrim's identity; met with playful teasing.\n\n**Becoming a Milk Maid:** Adult women may begin producing milk after taking Lactacid sold by alchemists, repeatedly drinking milk, or encountering magical curses, enchanted traps, or enchanted milking armor.\n\n**Enchanted Milking Armor:** Living armor, parasites, and Dwemer milking devices may attach to adult women, supply aphrodisiacs and milk-production stimulants, and drain their milk, bringing sublime pleasure.\n\n**New Enchanted Milking Armor Reaction:** Initial alarm may give way to sublime pleasure and cravings for the armor's continued stimulation.\n\n**Being Milked:** Eagerly desired; feels like ultimate ecstasy.\n\n**Fullness Paradox:** Empty breasts feel lighter and easier to manage, yet strangely lacking. Being heavy and full brings sublime satisfaction despite mild discomfort.",
